# Deploy flow

Vercel production is `main` → https://coolrealestatetools.com

## Until the user says they are live

When finishing work, commit and push to `main` unless they say not to.

## After they say they are live

Treat `main` as production.

- Do not push unfinished or routine feature work straight to `main`.
- Commit on a branch, push that branch, and open a PR when they want review.
- Merge or push to `main` only when they explicitly ask to ship or push to production.
- Never force-push `main`.
